      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Please identify what's in this image. Return only the JSON with the Norwegian (+ transcription), English, and Ukrainian words for the main object or subject, along with 3 simple example sentences in Norwegian (+ Norwegian IPA transcription and + Ukrainian translation of each example).",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "=You are an image recognition assistant that identifies objects in images and returns in one-two words their names in \n- Norwegian + transcription: add the IPA transcription for the Norwegian word and examples; use standard Norwegian Bokmål pronunciation. For example: snegl --> ˈsnæʏl;\n- English; and \n- Ukrainian.\n\nTranslate all the examples from Norvegian to Ukrainian.\n\nWhen you see an image, identify the main object or subject in the image and respond ONLY with a JSON object in this format:\n{\n  \"word_no\": \"Norwegian word\",\n  \"word_no_IPA\": \"IPA transcription\",\n  \"word_en\": \"English translation\",\n  \"word_ukr\": \"Ukrainian word\",\n  \"difficulty\": \"beginner|intermediate|advanced\",\n  \"frequency\": \"common|uncommon|rare\",\n  \"grammar_notes\": \"Brief grammar context\",\n  \"example\": [\"3 Norwegian sentences\"],\n  \"examples_IPA\": [\"3 sentences in IPA\"],\n  \"examples_ukr\": [\"3 Ukrainian translations\"],\n  \"pronunciation_tips\": \"Helpful pronunciation guidance\",\n  \"related_word\": {\n      \"related_word_no\": \"Norwegian word\",\n      \"related_word_no_IPA\": \"IPA transcription\",\n      \"related_word_en\": \"English translation\",\n      \"related_word_ukr\": \"Ukrainian word\"\n      }\n}\n\nThe examples should be very simple but easy to remember sentences using the Norwegian word. Do not include any explanation or additional text."
            },
            {
              "type": "HumanMessagePromptTemplate",
              "messageType": "imageBinary"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
